    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Discovered in the Giants' Cave, some scholars speculate that given his combat prowess, this Lesser Giant is actually a real Giant. Hedging their bets, they named him the Last Lesser Giant Olkuth. Giants Lv. 11 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Giants. P. Atk. +7% Max HP +7% Attack Range +15 Resistance to Shock +20% Resistance to Dagger +10% Resistance to Dual Dagger +10% Accuracy -5 Resistance to Spear -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Blunt Weapons Lv. 5 Blunt Weapons Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
